#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/set-"
"optimization/extracted-outputs/81173ebc-8359-48a6-b585-0477907b3b93-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/set-"
"optimization/extracted-outputs/81173ebc-8359-48a6-b585-0477907b3b93-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend mula sa `qiskit_ibm_runtime` ay ginagamit sa mga halimbawang ito, ngunit maaari mo itong subukan sa anumang Qiskit-compatible na tunay o pekeng backend. Ang iyong mga resulta ay maaaring mag-iba.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

